The following code segment is intended to display the number of elements in `nums` that are greater than 10.

```text
count ← 0
FOR EACH n IN nums
{
   IF (n ≥ 10)
   {
      count ← count + 1
   }
}
DISPLAY (count)
```

When `nums` is `[11, 8, 13, 2, 10]`, the code displays 3 instead of 2. Which change corrects the error?

